import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const y=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 913 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 12 — Myriad-Rank Origin Bidirectional Cycle","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 913 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 12 — Myriad-Rank Origin Bidirectional Cycle","no":913,"module":5,"tags":["Charter","Article 12","Myriad-Rank Origin Bidirectional Cycle","Energy Cycle","Symbiosis"],"related":["15-Energy Cycle and Transformation Law","25-Symbiotic Feedback Cycle Mechanism","12-Life-Cycle System Details"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0913_模块5-第十二条-万族本源双向循环.md","filePath":"en/0913_模块5-第十二条-万族本源双向循环.md"}'),r={name:"en/0913_模块5-第十二条-万族本源双向循环.md"};function o(s,e,l,c,d,h){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-913-myriad-rank-republican-civilizational-charter-·-article-12-—-myriad-rank-origin-bidirectional-cycle" tabindex="-1">Entry 913 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 12 — Myriad-Rank Origin Bidirectional Cycle <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-913-myriad-rank-republican-civilizational-charter-·-article-12-—-myriad-rank-origin-bidirectional-cycle" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 913 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 12 — Myriad-Rank Origin Bidirectional Cycle&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 15, 25, 12</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-not-one-way-transfusion-but-bidirectional-cycle" tabindex="-1">Introduction: not one-way transfusion, but bidirectional cycle <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-not-one-way-transfusion-but-bidirectional-cycle" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: not one-way transfusion, but bidirectional cycle&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Predatory systems&#39; energy relation is one-way — the strong drain from the weak, the more drained the drier. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s energy relation is bidirectional cycle: the strong one&#39;s origin feeds back the network; the network then distributes increments to Myriad Ranks; Myriad Ranks&#39; evolution in turn feeds back the network. Article 12 writes this &quot;Myriad-Rank-origin bidirectional cycle&quot; into the charter; it is the entire civilization&#39;s blood circulation system. Without it, Article 3&#39;s collective ascension cannot land; Article 8&#39;s more-work-more-pay has nothing to distribute.</p><p>This article is from beginning to end placed under the six top-level axioms — the anti-predation axiom draws the bottom line, the republican axiom of Myriad Races establishes the subject, the collective-ascension axiom sets the direction, the causal self-discipline axiom guards the boundary, the law-first axiom preserves self-consistency; the five together constitute this article&#39;s insurmountable spiritual boundary.</p><p>Together with the previous five axioms, this article is also bound by Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing and layabouts retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more and higher levels of infinity; predation thus fundamentally loses meaning.</p><h2 id="i-jurisprudential-basis" tabindex="-1">I. Jurisprudential Basis <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-jurisprudential-basis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Jurisprudential Basis&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This article is based on the Energy Cycle and Transformation Law (Document 15), the Symbiotic Feedback Cycle Mechanism (Document 25), and the Life-Cycle System Details (Document 12). Its jurisprudential core is the anti-predation axiom&#39;s &quot;develop increments&quot;: the cosmos is not a static resource container, but a life body that may be wholly ascended through orderly symbiosis. Predators consume stock and evolutionary potential; symbiotic civilization enlarges the cycle and produces increments, letting every participant benefit from the larger cycle.</p><h2 id="ii-normative-content-four-links-of-the-bidirectional-cycle" tabindex="-1">II. Normative Content: Four Links of the Bidirectional Cycle <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-normative-content-four-links-of-the-bidirectional-cycle" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Normative Content: Four Links of the Bidirectional Cycle&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Article 12 breaks the cycle into four supervisable links:</p><ol><li><strong>Upstream</strong>: the origin a cultivator gains returns to the network by contribution;</li><li><strong>Amplification</strong>: the network, through anchors and the law network, converts returned origin into increments (Multiplication-Fruit-type technical amplification);</li><li><strong>Downstream</strong>: increments are distributed back to Myriad Ranks along two lines — more-work-more-pay and every-road-available;</li><li><strong>Feedback</strong>: Myriad Ranks&#39; universal evolution raises network effectiveness, further amplifying the cycle.</li></ol><p>Four rings connect head to tail, forming an undepletable positive feedback, not a one-outlet-only drainage pipe.</p><h2 id="iii-scope" tabindex="-1">III. Scope <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-scope" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Scope&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This article applies to all life and institutions connected to the anchor network: from Sense-Realm new cultivators to Origin Realm strong ones, every cultivator&#39;s energy in-and-out is within the cycle. This article also binds cross-plane resource allocation — resource flow between planes must be bidirectional cycle; one-way draining of some plane (plane colonization&#39;s essence) is prohibited. The D route&#39;s human-made Dao-rules soul rings, Lin Hao route and other special systems&#39; energy output must likewise return to the cycle, no private domains allowed.</p><h2 id="iv-consequences-of-violation" tabindex="-1">IV. Consequences of Violation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consequences-of-violation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consequences of Violation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Intercepting and privately hoarding origin that should return, only taking from the network and never upstream, one-way draining some plane&#39;s resources, contaminating cycle purity by mixing in predated gains, all constitute unconstitutionality under this article. Consequences: intercepted parts are forcibly returned; contaminated parts are network-wide purified; those under the name of &quot;self-contained cycle&quot; actually running independent predation are pursued heavily under Article 1 anti-predation and Article 3 collective-ascension obligation.</p><h2 id="v-supervision-mechanism" tabindex="-1">V. Supervision Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-supervision-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Supervision Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This article is executed by the energy-flow monitoring within Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision: every node&#39;s upstream and downstream flow is real-time recorded; nodes that are out of budget and long only-take-no-give automatically alert; the Anchor Supervisory Committee monitors each plane&#39;s energy income and expenditure; if some plane is one-way drained, protection is immediately started. Cycle purity is guaranteed by energy-standardized metering (Document 65); once predatory residues are mixed in, network-wide tracing is triggered.</p><h2 id="vi-one-cycle-s-start-and-return" tabindex="-1">VI. One Cycle&#39;s Start and Return <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-one-cycle-s-start-and-return" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. One Cycle&#39;s Start and Return&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Article 12 may be understood through one complete energy journey. A new cultivator&#39;s hard-won thread of origin returns to the anchor network per contract-responsibility; the network through law amplification turns it into increments usable by Myriad Ranks; part of this increment returns to him per more-work-more-pay, part through every-road-available bottom-line goes to the lowest new life; that new life later grows and sends its own origin back to the network. This thread of energy completes one loop, from one person becoming Myriad Ranks&#39;, yet with ten times more value than if left in his body. This is the bidirectional cycle — not who supports whom, but everyone together making the cake bigger and bigger.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the bidirectional cycle amplifies every individual&#39;s cultivation results into network-wide increments, putting an end to energy idling in private domains</p></li><li><p><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the cycle institutionally negates &quot;draining stock,&quot; only allowing &quot;producing increments&quot;</p></li><li><p><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-type systems strong ones eat fatter and fatter, planes drain drier and drier; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s bidirectional cycle, Myriad Ranks rise with the tide</p></li><li><p><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the cycle&#39;s beneficiaries are all Myriad Ranks, not the cycle&#39;s designers</p></li><li><p><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the cycle expands as new planes and new clans connect; the larger the scale, the stronger the effectiveness</p></li><li><p><strong>Universal equal infinity</strong>: every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing layabouts retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose higher-level infinity; predation thus fundamentally loses meaning</p></li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Myriad-Rank-origin bidirectional cycle is the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s heart. Once the heart stops, civilization regresses to predatory stagnant water; once the heart beats, every life&#39;s effort pushes the whole cosmos to ascend. This cycle held, civilization is alive.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/15-能量循环与转化法则.html">Entry 15 · Energy Cycle and Transformation Law</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/25-共生反馈循环机制.html">Entry 25 · Symbiotic Feedback Cycle Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/12-生命循环体系详解.html">Entry 12 · Life-Cycle System Details</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/904_模块5-第三条-集体升维义务.html">Entry 904 · Article 3 Collective-Ascension Obligation</a></li></ul>',26)])])}const m=i(r,[["render",o]]);export{y as __pageData,m as default};
